WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:08.170
Keep one profile for each brand, with its category, tier and the people you deal with.

2
00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:14.150
Brands lists every brand you have spoken to, with its leads and latest stage.

3
00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.630
Search by name or filter by category.

4
00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:21.490
To add one, choose Add brand.

5
00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:26.620
Write the brand name as customers know it.

6
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:32.710
Choose its category and tier. They drive the reports and the tenant mix.

7
00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:42.960
Add how many stores they run and their website or Instagram.

8
00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:49.650
Save the brand.

9
00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:58.120
The brand page opens. Now add the people you deal with: choose Add contact.

10
00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:02.300
Fill in the name, job title and phone.

11
00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:17.780
Add the contact. Their phone and WhatsApp are one click away from every lead of this brand.
